    "identifier": "lyonesse-knight-of-the-sacred-word-voice-of-authority-yield",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your voice carries force that can command the body as surely as your strikes. Once per turn, when you hit a creature with a Monk weapon or an Unarmed Strike, you can expend 1 Focus Point to issue a single-word command as part of the attack. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or suffer one of the following effects of your choice until the start of your next turn:</p><p><strong>Halt.</strong> The creature’s Speed becomes 0.</p><p><strong>Silence.</strong> The creature cannot speak or cast spells with Verbal components.</p><p><strong>Yield.</strong> The creature has Disadvantage on attack rolls.</p>"
    },
